category: Net
build-depends: cygport libfmt-devel libiconv-devel libintl-devel libssl-devel libuv-devel rapidjson-devel
sdesc: "Monero (XMR) Stratum protocol proxy"
ldesc: "Extremely high performance Monero (XMR) Stratum protocol proxy, can easily
handle over 100K connections on cheap $5 (1024 MB) virtual machine. Reduce
number of pool connections up to 256 times, 100K workers become just 391
worker on pool side. Written on C++/libuv same as XMRig miner."
